            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "About Nursing Now",
                  "type": "text",
                  "marks": [
                    {
                      "type": "bold"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "Nursing Now is a global, three-year long campaign run in collaboration with the World Health Organization and the International Council of Nurses. The campaign aims to raise the status and profile of nursing and midwifery professions.  ",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "In January 2019, Pakistan also became part of this campaign joining forces with nurse leaders from around the world.   ",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "Learn more",
